ine Implementation Details</strong>: <em>V8 engine implements WeakMap using=
 a combination of hidden classes and weak references. When an object stored=
 as WeakMap key becomes unreachable, V8's garbage collector automatically r=
emoves the corresponding entry during the next GC cycle.</em></p>
