<h4 class=3D"text-base font-bold text-text-100 mt-1">Common Mental Models</=
h4>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Mental Model 1: "Ghost R=
eferences"</strong></p>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">WeakMap keys are like "ghosts" =
- they exist but don't prevent the original from moving on</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">When the original object "dies"=
, the ghost automatically disappears</li>
</ul>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Mental Model 2: "Shadow =
Storage"</strong></p>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">WeakMap creates a "shadow" stor=
age that follows the main object</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">When main object is destroyed, =
shadow automatically vanishes</li>
</ul>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Mental Model 3: "Sticky =
Notes vs. Permanent Records"</strong></p>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Regular Map =3D Writing in perm=
anent ink</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">WeakMap =3D Using sticky notes =
that fall off when object moves</li>
</ul>
